<section class="section">
	<div class="section__inner">
		<p>I lead design across <a href="https://www.totara.com/">Totara</a>'s learning platform. My work spans UX strategy, design systems, accessibility and the tooling that connects design to code. Most recently I have been moving our design practice to an AI-first way of working.</p>
		<p>Before Totara, I spent more than ten years at <a href="https://www.silverstripe.com/">Silverstripe</a>, leading UX for the open-source CMS and Silverstripe Cloud, and helping build the all-of-government Common Web Platform.</p>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
	<div class="section__inner">
		<h2>Highlights</h2>
		<div class="highlight">
			<h3>One token system across old and new products</h3>
			<p>All core components in the new framework draw from a single token contract, and 43% of the legacy library already connects to it. <a href="/case-study-token-system.html">Read the token system case study</a></p>
		</div>
		<div class="highlight">
			<h3>AI that measures, not only generates</h3>
			<p>My team combined AI-assisted analysis with design review to map all 471 legacy variables and turn the gaps into a check the build enforces. <a href="/case-study-ai-first-practice.html">Read the AI-first practice case study</a></p>
		</div>
		<div class="highlight">
			<h3>Fifteen years leading design teams</h3>
			<p>I have led small, multidisciplinary teams of designers and researchers at Silverstripe and Totara, building the systems and standards that let a small team support an enterprise platform.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

